{"scene_id": "s02474", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/gen/scenes/s02474.fountain", "heading": "EXT. BRAZOS RIVER FERRY - DUSK", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "MARSHAL AUGUSTINE PELL", "names": ["MARSHAL AUGUSTINE PELL", "PELL"], "gender": "m", "first": 3, "spoke": 2}, {"id": 1, "name": "LOLA TREVINO", "names": ["LOLA TREVINO", "LOLA"], "gender": "?", "first": 4, "spoke": 1}, {"id": 2, "name": "BARNABY", "names": ["BARNABY"], "gender": "?", "first": 5, "spoke": 1}, {"id": 3, "name": "ROOK STALLWORTH", "names": ["ROOK STALLWORTH"], "gender": "m", "first": 6, "spoke": 0}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "EXT. BRAZOS RIVER FERRY - DUSK", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "A flat-bottomed ferry the colour of old tobacco hangs on a rope across a river the width of a town street and the colour of weak coffee.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "Sun lies low and red behind the cottonwoods.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "MARSHAL AUGUSTINE PELL, 50s, long grey coat, a face like cracked saddle leather, stands at the bow with his hand on his Colt.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "Beside him sits LOLA TREVINO, 20s, wrists bound with rope, hair full of dust, staring at the water.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "At the stern, BARNABY, 70, the ferryman, thin as a fence rail, hauls on the rope hand over hand.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "Across the river, on the far bank, two riders have stopped under the trees: the brothers DUNCAN and ROOK STALLWORTH, one fat, one wiry, rifles across their saddles.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 7, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Barnaby. How long to the landing?", "name": "PELL", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 8, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Ten minutes. Eight if you quit looking at them.", "name": "BARNABY", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 9, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "They're not going anywhere.", "name": "PELL", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Neither am I.", "name": "LOLA", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "action", "text": "Pell does not turn.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "action", "text": "Duncan raises a hand.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "action", "text": "Rook, beside him, does not.", "para": 3, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "action", "text": "The ferry creaks on.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "Rope hisses through Barnaby's gloves.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "action", "text": "The riders begin to walk their horses down to the water.", "para": 4, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}]}